#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Admin > Financial, redesigned (the same settings, buttons and texts as before).
 *  - Payment methods: number tiles (methods, turned on, without a gateway, countries); a gold "Add a payment method" card; one card per method
 *    (logo, names, on/off switch, its gateway or "No provider set", "N of M countries active" with a bar, order arrows, edit, delete).
 *    Its countries: a navy band with how many are active, a search, Activate / Deactivate all, the countries as switch tiles.
 *  - Payment providers: "N of M providers set up" with a bar; one card per provider (Configured / Not configured, Set up / Edit keys);
 *    a provider: a navy band and its key form (secret keys marked, "set: sk_...7f3a"), Clear credentials and Save.
 *  - Payouts: number tiles (owed, suppliers with a balance, without a bank account, paid in the last 30 days); the history with initials.
 *  - Pricing: the price equation on top (supplier's price + fees x exchange rate - discounts = buyer pays; each part opens its section);
 *    the rate large both ways; the fees as numbered step cards with a gold "Add a fee" card; the preview as a receipt.
 * Profits and Shipping costs are unchanged: they were built in this design already.
 * Admin only (no API change).
 *   node scripts/patch-financial-redesign.js            dry run
 *   node scripts/patch-financial-redesign.js --write    applies it
 */
